entries[115313] = { ["name"] = "Summon Jade Serpent Statue", ["text"] = "40 yd range\nInstant 30 sec cooldown\nRequires Serpent Stance\nMistweaver ( Hotfix Passive )\nSummons a Jade Serpent Statue at the target location. Lasts for 15 min. Only one statue can be active at a time.\n\nEminence (Passive)\nWhen the Monk deals non-autoattack damage, the summoned Jade Serpent Statue will heal the lowest health nearby target within 20 yards equal to 42% of the damage done.\n\nSerpent's Accord (Passive)\nWhen you cast Soothing Mist, the Jade Serpent Statue will also cast Soothing Mist on an injured ally within 40 yards.\n\nSummons a Jade Serpent Statue at the target location. Lasts for 15 min. Only one statue can be active at a time.\n\nEminence (Passive)\nWhen the Monk deals non-autoattack damage, the summoned Jade Serpent Statue will heal the lowest health nearby target within 20 yards equal to 25% of the damage done.\n\nSerpent's Accord (Passive)\nWhen you cast Soothing Mist, the Jade Serpent Statue will also cast Soothing Mist on an injured ally within 40 yards." }
