entries[115315] = { ["name"] = "Summon Black Ox Statue", ["text"] = "40 yd range\nInstant 30 sec cooldown\nRequires Ox Stance\nSummons a Black Ox Statue at the target location. Lasts for 15 min. Only one Black Ox Statue can be summoned at any one time.\n\nThe Black Ox Statue interacts with your Provoke and Leer of the Ox abilities.\n\nSanctuary of the Ox (Passive)\nEverytime the Monk deals (Attack Power * 16) damage, the Black Ox statue will cast Guard on an injured party or raid member within 40 yards absorbing [((Attack Power * 1.971) + 14232 ) * 1 ] damage lasting 30 sec. This effect cannot be cast onto the Monk." }
